00:02:30.099 --> 00:02:33.069
You, your team, your staff needs to know this
language.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:34.209
This is the book I would recommend.

00:02:34.209 --> 00:02:36.680
#9 - The next one I would recommend is Contagious.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:43.120
Contagious is a very good book that describes
the certain elements combined together that

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.870
makes up for something to go viral, for something
to spread.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:52.480
And the words it uses is social currency,
triggers, emotion, public, practical value,

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.140
