blender chopping up this phone and this blender

00:03:17.299 --> 00:03:18.609
blows up.

00:03:18.609 --> 00:03:24.049
Because the point of this blender was it is
so powerful, it can tear up an iPhone.

00:03:24.049 --> 00:03:27.709
That became the marketing campaign on how
to tell the story of how amazing of a blender

00:03:27.709 --> 00:03:28.709
this is.

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:31.170
This blender started selling blenders all
over the world.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:34.299
Very, very good book to read for marketing
is contagious.

00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:37.459
I'd say the other one is Made to Stick - I
don't know if I have one here with me.

00:03:37.459 --> 00:03:39.250
