00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:49.499
Made to Stick is a book that explains to you
how this story sticks with your audience.

00:03:49.499 --> 00:03:54.340
How a lot of times you will tell a story where
somebody will not remember, and then here's

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.340
