00:04:12.359 --> 00:04:14.349
That story is made to stick.

00:04:14.349 --> 00:04:16.329
It sticks with you.

00:04:16.329 --> 00:04:20.120
You will forever link this company to the
story that was shared with you because it

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.230
